{"title":"World History Timeline","link":"https://kottke.org/26/05/world-history-timeline","date":1778860800000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1778856644-f0b5f843.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1778856644-f0b5f843.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1778856644-f0b5f843.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><a href=\"https://imgur.com/world-history-map-by-schofield-sims-great-reference-how-cultures-move-change-q406aHD\">This World History Timeline (2016)</a> shows how nations, empires, and ruling groups shifted and evolved across the globe from 3000 BCE to the present. It takes a second to understand what you’re looking at — I thought it was a sort of stretched geographical map at first. <a href=\"https://www.schofieldandsims.co.uk/world-history-timeline/\">Get your own here</a>.</p>\n\t<p>The chart is based on Joseph Priestley’s <a href=\"https://bostonraremaps.com/inventory/priestley-new-chart-of-history/\">A New Chart of History (1769)</a>:</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1778857444-18a98222.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1778857444-18a98222.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1778857444-18a98222.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Priestley\">Priestley</a> is best known for his co-discovery of oxygen.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/infoviz\">infoviz</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Joseph%20Priestley\">Joseph Priestley</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/maps\">maps</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/timelines\">timelines</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"31fcef768d74f45a9de59b0162431f92b8485ed7027d122bd5c8609e2fe36442","category":"Sites"}